<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1828890964"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:41.943"><div begin="27.436" end="52.971" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="27.436" end="31.625" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.436" end="29.032">匆匆忙忙等着</span><span begin="29.032" end="29.463">和</span><span begin="29.463" end="30.061">青春说</span><span begin="30.061" end="30.784">声再</span><span begin="30.784" end="31.625">会</span></p><p begin="34.303" end="38.515" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.303" end="35.306">等到后来</span><span begin="35.306" end="36.355">被生活</span><span begin="36.355" end="37.290">搞得伤痕</span><span begin="37.290" end="38.515">累累</span></p><p begin="41.162" end="45.630" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.162" end="42.171">终于等到</span><span begin="42.171" end="42.858">那首</span><span begin="42.858" end="44.720">不敢听的</span><span begin="44.720" end="45.630">歌</span></p><p begin="47.267" end="52.971" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.267" end="48.774">听得我</span><span begin="48.948" end="50.457">放开声</span><span begin="50.653" end="52.971">哭了</span></p></div><div begin="54.838" end="1:20.289" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="54.838" end="58.997" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.838" end="55.824">我喝醉后没</span><span begin="55.824" end="56.941">有等到</span><span begin="56.941" end="57.988">人能陪我</span><span begin="57.988" end="58.997">聊天</span></p><p begin="1:01.738" end="1:05.961" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.738" end="1:02.711">工作了好</span><span begin="1:02.711" end="1:03.996">几年也没</span><span begin="1:03.996" end="1:05.045">存下什麼</span><span begin="1:05.045" end="1:05.961">钱</span></p><p begin="1:08.603" end="1:13.102" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.603" end="1:09.544">喔 曾经等过</span><span begin="1:09.544" end="1:11.245">海誓山盟</span><span begin="1:11.245" end="1:12.054">好几</span><span begin="1:12.054" end="1:13.102">回</span></p><p begin="1:14.639" end="1:20.289" itunes:key="L8" ttm